<title>USA: Nautica Q4 Feb 28 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Nautica Q4 Feb 28 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>NAUTICA ENTERPRISES INC</p>
<p>			    Twelve Months Ended  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				Feb. 28,  Feb. 29,  Feb. 28, Feb. 29,</p>
<p>				     1997	1996	1997    1996</p>
<p> Net sales		    $386,560 $302,541   $90,510 $69,720</p>
<p> Gross profit		  181,008  137,079    44,602  33,700</p>
<p> SG&amp;A			    115,476   88,914    28,814  21,608</p>
<p> Net royalty income	    3,803    2,248	 994     743</p>
<p> Interest income		 2,996    2,521     1,031     750</p>
<p>Earnings before taxes and</p>
<p>  minority interest	   72,331   52,934    17,813  13,585</p>
<p> Net earnings		   44,040   31,986    11,330   8,377</p>
<p> Earnings per share*	    1.02	.75	 .26     .20</p>
<p> Weighted average shares*   43,147   42,717    42,825  42,731</p>
<p>		 (all amounts in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: All share and per share data have been adjusted to reflect a two-for-one stock split effected in the form of a 100% stock dividend which was issued on May 28, 1996.</p>
</text>
